  "findings": [
    "MEASURED: at seed 0 the LoRA and QLoRA builds produced the same label on all 1031 test rows \u2014 identical accuracy 0.9913 and macro-F1, so there is no accuracy cost to test",
    "MEASURED: LoRA accuracy over 3 seeds spans 0.9855-0.9913; the single QLoRA seed falls inside that range",
    "MEASURED: both methods train the identical 739,586 parameters; the QLoRA adapter is 1.67x larger on disk purely because four tensors were written F32 instead of BF16",
